flowchart TD
  request[GET request] --> validation{Valid parameters}
  validation -- no --> error[HTTP 200 ok false trace_id]
  validation -- yes --> lookup{Redis key exists}
  lookup -- yes --> hit[Return cached successful JSON]
  lookup -- no --> lock[Acquire per key lock]
  lock --> recheck{Check key again}
  recheck -- hit --> hit
  recheck -- miss --> adapter[Read source through adapter]
  adapter --> success{Successful response}
  success -- yes --> store[Store JSON with TTL]
  store --> release[Release lock and return]
  success -- no --> skip[Release lock without caching error]
  skip --> error
